      "id": "08-pros",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "pros",
      "text": "Pros first: glucosinolate-rich brassica profile. Kale brings a brassica-specific phytochemical angle beyond its vitamin bars. Has a more specific food identity. There is a reason it earns attention beyond the basic role. Leafy volume with very low calorie pressure. It adds a lot of plate volume without much energy load.",
