    {
      "id": "09-cons",
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "cons",
      "text": "Cons next: freshness and prep can matter. Older or badly prepared kale can turn tough and bitter fast. Raw texture can be a barrier. The chewy texture can make it harder to enjoy raw than softer greens. Strong leafy flavour is not for everyone. It is nutrient-dense, but some people just do not like the bitter leafy taste.",
      "textSha256": "88b1d082eb89d64cc953047fd210bff2e3452133f1aab26e0ffe718e80a7db2b",
      "characterCount": 323,
